    "detailed_description": "<strong>A Game from the &quot;Legends of Savvarah&quot; series.</strong><br><br>Nikaria is an agent of Chazir, a servant of the mysterious god Dadar, who after a mystical ritual ceased to be human. Now, her entire body is a weapon, Dadar's weapon.<br><br>She has no moral boundaries. The end justifies any means, and Dadar's will are above any mortal law.<br><br>Chazir sends Nikaria to another country as a spy. She will meet other agents, becoming entangled in their internal disputes, which may jeopardize her entire mission.<br><br>Will Nikaria eliminate everyone who stands in her way? Will she fail the mission? Will she resolve all conflicts? Or will she arrive at a completely different ending? The decision is up to you.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear storyline: 11 endings and numerous ways to reach them. Your choices truly matter;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Vibrant visual style, original soundtrack;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Well-crafted, vivid characters with whom various, including romantic relationships, can be formed (3 romantic interests);</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A detailed, original fantasy world that goes beyond the game storyline.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A Game from the &quot;Legends of Savvarah&quot; series.</strong><br><br>Nikaria is an agent of Chazir, a servant of the mysterious god Dadar, who after a mystical ritual ceased to be human. Now, her entire body is a weapon, Dadar's weapon.<br><br>She has no moral boundaries. The end justifies any means, and Dadar's will are above any mortal law.<br><br>Chazir sends Nikaria to another country as a spy. She will meet other agents, becoming entangled in their internal disputes, which may jeopardize her entire mission.<br><br>Will Nikaria eliminate everyone who stands in her way? Will she fail the mission? Will she resolve all conflicts? Or will she arrive at a completely different ending? The decision is up to you.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear storyline: 11 endings and numerous ways to reach them. Your choices truly matter;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Vibrant visual style, original soundtrack;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Well-crafted, vivid characters with whom various, including romantic relationships, can be formed (3 romantic interests);</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A detailed, original fantasy world that goes beyond the game storyline.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are Nikaria. An agent of a mysterious god, sent to another country. Does the end justify the means? Is the will of the god above the law? Is the death of a non-believer insignificant? The decision is yours alone.",
